1
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:12,320
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,800
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:18,480
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:21,680
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,800
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:29,280
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,200
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:35,400
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:39,400
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:42,600
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:45,320
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:48,680
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:59,000
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,400
=Episode 3=

15
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:02,159
Who are you really?

16
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:52,880
(Bai Zhi, Lord of the Myriad Demon Hall)

17
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:02,599
- Greetings, Holy Lord.
- Greetings, Holy Lord.

18
00:02:05,159 --> 00:02:05,799
Rise.

19
00:02:07,439 --> 00:02:08,159
(Left Protector)
Holy Lord,

20
00:02:08,439 --> 00:02:09,800
(The Myriad Demon Hall)
we haven't heard from you in six months.

21
00:02:10,039 --> 00:02:10,920
(Right Protector)
The two of us

22
00:02:10,920 --> 00:02:11,879
(The Myriad Demon Hall)
sensed your presence

23
00:02:12,039 --> 00:02:13,000
and rushed over at once.

24
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,800
We're so glad you're safe.

25
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:17,120
If those three hadn't ambushed me,

26
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:20,120
I wouldn't have spent
all this time recovering.

27
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:21,960
Holy Lord, to prevent any mishaps,

28
00:02:22,199 --> 00:02:23,400
I suggest you enter seclusion at once

29
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,360
in case the Three Sword Immortals

30
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:26,520
attack our sect again.

31
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,599
Go into seclusion?

32
00:02:31,159 --> 00:02:32,080
I'd hoped

33
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:35,639
we could have
a few more quiet decades together.

34
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:37,039
But I never expected

35
00:02:37,439 --> 00:02:39,599
I'd still have so many ties
I couldn't let go of.

36
00:02:41,599 --> 00:02:42,520
You saved my life,

37
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,879
so I'll give you a great opportunity.

38
00:02:54,719 --> 00:02:55,639
Holy Lord, no!

39
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:57,439
How can you give your own Dao Bone

40
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,639
to this mortal?

41
00:02:59,280 --> 00:02:59,800
Exactly.

42
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,199
His meridians are damaged.

43
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:02,719
Your Dao Bone may be

44
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,240
of no use to him.

45
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:08,440
♪These wounds upon my skin♪

46
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:13,240
♪Are how the years have crowned me♪

47
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:19,680
♪Through fading lights,
I finally see it clear♪

48
00:03:37,199 --> 00:03:38,360
I have a thousand Dao Bones.

49
00:03:39,719 --> 00:03:40,680
He saved my life,

50
00:03:41,599 --> 00:03:43,159
so what's wrong with giving him one?

51
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:45,280
You do have a thousand Dao Bones,

52
00:03:45,479 --> 00:03:46,280
but the one you're giving him

53
00:03:46,479 --> 00:03:48,000
is your strongest sacred-grade Dao Bone.

54
00:03:48,199 --> 00:03:49,319
What makes him worthy of that?

55
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,520
If I say he's worthy,

56
00:03:50,759 --> 00:03:51,719
then he's worthy!

57
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:55,680
(Take care.)

58
00:03:56,439 --> 00:03:57,639
(I hope one day)

59
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,439
(we'll meet again.)

60
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:22,480
Bai?

61
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:23,439
Bai?

62
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:42,959
Who?

63
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,040
Who was it?

64
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:49,759
Why?

65
00:04:51,319 --> 00:04:52,879
Why can't I protect anyone?

66
00:05:03,319 --> 00:05:04,759
(Why is spiritual energy
surging through me?)

67
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:08,000
(I have a Dao Bone again?)

68
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:28,600
♪Crossing rivers and seas♪

69
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,680
♪I drink in warmth and cold,
tempering my courage♪

70
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:35,960
♪Like a firefly
sailing through the night♪

71
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:38,080
♪My flame is small, yet still it glows♪

72
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:39,320
(Body Tempering Realm, Stage 1)

73
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,279
What's going on with this Dao Bone?

74
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:44,959
Whose is it?

75
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:48,079
Why can't I tell what grade it is?

76
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:51,959
Bai,

77
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,079
I can cultivate again.

78
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:57,759
Did you see that?

79
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,199
A Tianxuan token...

80
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:24,399
A warrior from Tianxuan Kingdom.

81
00:06:26,319 --> 00:06:28,920
Looks like Tianxuan Kingdom
is behind this somehow!

82
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:32,040
Now that I have a Dao Bone,

83
00:06:33,399 --> 00:06:35,120
I need to transform my meridians
and cleanse my marrow soon,

84
00:06:35,879 --> 00:06:36,879
and heal my old injuries.

85
00:06:37,759 --> 00:06:38,920
The Heavenly Sword Sect's Alchemy Hall

86
00:06:39,839 --> 00:06:41,120
would be a good place to do it.

87
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:45,360
I need to become a formal disciple soon.

88
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:57,200
(Cuihua, Heavenly Sword Sect
Servant Disciple)

89
00:06:59,319 --> 00:07:00,040
Senior Brother Zhao.

90
00:07:02,519 --> 00:07:03,279
Don't call me Senior Brother.

91
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:04,959
We're both servant disciples.

92
00:07:05,439 --> 00:07:07,360
Others might hear and cause trouble.

93
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:09,079
All right then.

94
00:07:20,199 --> 00:07:20,759
Take this,

95
00:07:21,199 --> 00:07:21,680
Senior Brother Zhao...

96
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:24,839
I made it myself.

97
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:25,800
It's for you.

98
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:27,319
It's really good.

99
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,240
Just take it.

100
00:07:34,319 --> 00:07:34,839
Thank you.

101
00:08:13,959 --> 00:08:14,720
What are you guys up to?

102
00:08:15,879 --> 00:08:17,120
Don't get the wrong idea, Zhao Feiyang.

103
00:08:17,399 --> 00:08:18,079
We had no idea

104
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:20,120
you were the fiancé
of the Holy Maiden of Tianxuan Kingdom.

105
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:21,560
We offended you before.

106
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:22,839
Here.

107
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:25,560
These spirit crystals

108
00:08:25,959 --> 00:08:27,160
are our way of apologizing.

109
00:08:29,319 --> 00:08:30,920
(Is this because of Chen Qiushui?)

110
00:08:33,759 --> 00:08:34,240
I don't need them.

111
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:37,679
Zhao Feiyang,

112
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,240
don't be so ungrateful!

113
00:08:41,039 --> 00:08:41,519
Get lost!

114
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:46,919
Fine.

115
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:48,679
Fine. You win.

116
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:50,240
- Let's go.
- Just you wait!

117
00:08:59,200 --> 00:08:59,919
Sorry, Holy Maiden.

118
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,080
That guy

119
00:09:01,639 --> 00:09:02,279
wouldn't have it.

120
00:09:03,879 --> 00:09:04,399
Forget it.

121
00:09:04,879 --> 00:09:05,679
You may leave.

122
00:09:06,759 --> 00:09:07,120
Alright.

123
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:10,159
We wish you success
in obtaining the divine-grade Dao Bone.

124
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:10,919
Once you do,

125
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,399
please look out for us.

126
00:09:12,879 --> 00:09:13,519
Sure.

127
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:23,279
What's wrong with Qingzhu?

128
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,399
She went to kill some village woman

129
00:09:25,399 --> 00:09:26,720
and ended up going missing herself.

130
00:09:26,879 --> 00:09:27,399
Forget it.

131
00:09:28,879 --> 00:09:30,720
Once I claim that divine-grade Dao Bone,

132
00:09:31,159 --> 00:09:32,000
I'll go find her.

133
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:34,320
(The Day the Dao Bone Emerges)

134
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:34,879
Today,

135
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:38,200
a divine-grade Dao Bone
has emerged in our sect.

136
00:09:38,399 --> 00:09:40,000
(Heavenly Sword Sect)
Who will ultimately claim it

137
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,279
has yet to be decided.

138
00:09:41,559 --> 00:09:43,240
It all comes down to strength

139
00:09:43,399 --> 00:09:44,320
and fate.

140
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:45,879
(Wang Feng, Heavenly Sword Sect Master)
Activate the formation!

141
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:33,760
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

142
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:36,760
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

143
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:40,400
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

144
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:44,320
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

145
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:48,600
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

146
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:51,680
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

147
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:55,200
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

148
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:59,360
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

149
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:03,360
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

150
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:06,840
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

151
00:11:07,280 --> 00:11:10,080
♪With this flesh and soul♪

152
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:13,440
♪I shall forge a new age♪

153
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:16,720
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

154
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:20,160
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

155
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:22,720
♪At cultivation's peak♪

156
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:25,440
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

157
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:29,840
♪The sun and moon turn♪

158
00:11:30,280 --> 00:11:33,240
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

159
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:38,720
♪I am the undying flame♪

160
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:45,160
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

161
00:11:46,520 --> 00:11:48,480
♪At last I see, immortality♪

162
00:11:49,880 --> 00:11:53,320
♪Lives in your smiles.♪
